Futya
------

Futya is a Low-Level and Efficient Operating System to ARM64, written in Assembly, C, C++, Java and JavaScript.

1. GITHUB 
Please fork the QMX-Corporation/Futya and, clone (git clone).

2. SEE THE CODE 
Please see the code, after modify the code.

3. COMMIT, PUSH 
After modify, please commit (git commit) and push (git push origin main or your branch).

4. PullRequest();
Entry in Site (https://github.com/QMX-Corporation/Futya) and click in "Contribute with project" -> after, click in 
"Open Pull Request".

5. WAITING 
Wait me or others maintainers/reviewers review and reject/accept the code.